# ROOFCAT: the scroll stops at the harbour arena and Old Crab rises: 35 hit
# points, and only a star in the eye hurts it. Its legs are the footing.
# Beating it delivers the parcel (the Saucer) but pays no points.
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat area 4 1
cheat clear_foes
cheat arena
wait 10
expect in_arena == 1
expect boss_hp == 35
cheat put 170 50
press B 1
wait 20
expect boss_hp == 34
cheat put 60 83
press B 1
wait 30
expect boss_hp == 34
expect score == 0
cheat win
wait 30
expect boss_dead == 1
expect score == 0
wait 200
expect state == 4
expect goals & 2
expect goals !& 4
